---
description: AuditX workstream routing and frontend design rules. Applies to every session.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` in the repo root and follow it exactly. It tells you how to pick up the user's stream (auth, admin, employee or analysis), see what has already been built, and continue from there.

For any frontend work, `DESIGN.md` is mandatory: use its tokens, type scale and stack, and never use emojis or generic AI-dashboard styling.
